the Trout Fire Burn Scar.

* Some locations that will experience flash flooding include...
Allie Canyon, Bear Canyon, Cottonwood Canyon, Shingle Canyon,
Soldiers Canyon, Mimbres River Preserve, Three Circle Canyon,
Mimbres, Camp Thunderbird and Upper Mimbres Valley.
</description>
        <instruction>This is a life threatening situation. Heavy rainfall will cause
extensive and severe flash flooding of creeks...streams...and
ditches in the Trout Fire Burn Scar. Severe debris flows can also be
anticipated across roads. Roads and driveways may be washed away in
places. If you encounter flood waters...climb to safety.

Be aware of your surroundings and do not drive on flooded roads.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
