        <senderName>NWS Melbourne FL</senderName>
        <headline>Special Marine Warning issued August 5 at 6:54PM EDT until August 5 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>SMWMLB

The National Weather Service in Melbourne has issued a

* Special Marine Warning for...
Flagler Beach to Volusia-Brevard County Line 0-20 nm...

* Until 800 PM EDT.

* At 653 PM EDT, a strong thunderstorm was located over Holly Hill,
moving east at 5 knots.

HAZARD...Wind gusts 34 knots or greater.

SOURCE...Radar.

IMPACT...Expect wind gusts in excess of 34 knots, suddenly higher
waves, lightning and heavy downpours. Make sure all on
board are wearing life jackets. Return to safe harbor if
possible.

* Locations impacted include...
Daytona Beach Shores, Holly Hill, South Daytona, Daytona Beach, and
Wilbur By The Sea.
</description>
