        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 5 at 7:00PM EDT until August 5 at 7:15PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>At 659 PM EDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from near Casselberry to near Pine Castle, moving east at 5
mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Orlando, Altamonte Springs, Oviedo, Winter Springs, and Winter Park.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
