        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...SE wind 20 kt increasing to 30 kt after midnight. Seas
8 ft.
.WED...SE wind 35 kt. Seas 11 ft. Rain showers.
.WED NIGHT...SW wind 20 kt. N of Dangerous Cape, SE wind 30 kt
becoming S 20 kt after midnight. Seas 11 ft. Rain showers.
.THU AND THU NIGHT...S wind 15 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.FRI THROUGH SAT...E wind 15 kt. Seas 7 ft.
.SUN...SW wind 15 kt. Seas 5 ft.
</description>
