        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 5 at 7:46PM EDT until August 5 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>At 746 PM EDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from near Maytown to Lake Hart, moving east at 10 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Orlando, Oviedo, Winter Springs, Wedgefield, and Avalon Park.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
