HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Ellendale, Oakes, Fullerton, Ludden, Guelph, and Glover.
</description>
        <instruction>A Tornado Watch remains in effect until 1000 PM CDT for southeastern
North Dakota.

