        <senderName>NWS Grand Forks ND</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 5 at 7:48PM CDT until August 5 at 8:15PM CDT by NWS Grand Forks ND</headline>
        <description>At 747 PM CDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from near Elliott to near Brampton to near Sunset Colony,
moving east at 35 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Lisbon, Gwinner, Forman, Rutland, Cogswell, Fort Ransom, and Havana.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.

Torrential rainfall is occurring with these storms, and may lead to
flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction>
