        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 5 at 8:08PM CDT until August 5 at 8:15PM CDT by NWS Grand Forks ND</headline>
        <description>The storms which prompted the warning have weakened below severe
limits, and no longer pose an immediate threat to life or property.
