Park. Some area farmland is flooded. Minor flooding occurs at the
Carolina Eastman Facility.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 8:00 PM EDT Tuesday the stage was 109.2 feet.
- Bankfull stage is 114.0 feet.
- Forecast...The river is expected to rise above flood stage
early tomorrow afternoon to a crest of 118.8 feet Thursday
evening. It will then fall below flood stage early Saturday
afternoon.
