        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 5 at 8:13PM CDT until August 5 at 8:15PM CDT by NWS Aberdeen SD</headline>
        <description>The storms which prompted the warning have weakened below severe
limits, and no longer pose an immediate threat to life or property.
Therefore, the warning will be allowed to expire.  However, heavy
rain is still possible with these thunderstorms.

A Tornado Watch remains in effect until 1000 PM CDT for northeastern
South Dakota.
