        <headline>Gale Warning issued August 6 at 3:31PM AKDT until August 7 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore waters forecast for the Gulf of Alaska West of 144W

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...S wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 8 to 12 ft. Rain.
.THU...SW wind 20 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.THU NIGHT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.FRI...S wind 20 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...SE wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 5 to 9 ft.
.SAT THROUGH MON...W wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 6 to 11 ft.
</description>
