        <senderName>NWS Fairbanks AK</senderName>
        <headline>Red Flag Warning issued August 6 at 4:00PM AKDT until August 7 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK</headline>
        <description>* AFFECTED AREA...Delta Junction.

* TIMING...From 9 AM to 5 PM AKDT Thursday.

* WINDS...South 20 to 30 mph with gusts up to 50 mph.

* HUMIDITY...As low as 26 percent.

* TEMPERATURES...Highs in the mid 70s.

* IMPACTS...New fire starts are possible. Ongoing fires can
spread rapidly with dry and windy conditions.
</description>
        <instruction>A Red Flag Warning means that conditions are occurring or will
occur which could lead to the development of large and dangerous
fires. It is directed toward fire agencies, and through them, to
the public.

Please advise the appropriate officials or fire crews in the
field of this Red Flag Warning.</instruction>
