        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 6 at 6:35PM MDT until August 6 at 6:45PM MDT by NWS Rapid City SD</headline>
        <description>At 635 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Alva, or 22
miles north of Sundance, moving east at 20 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to
roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Alva and Bear Lodge Campground.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
