XOUS52 KWBC 070052

CAPMHX

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2">
    <identifier>urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.885a715fba1c503f79ceea8f955eacd575da7451.001.1</identifier>
    <sender>w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov</sender>
    <sent>2025-08-06T20:52:00-04:00</sent>
    <status>Actual</status>
    <msgType>Alert</msgType>
    <scope>Public</scope>
    <code>IPAWSv1.0</code>
    <info>
        <language>en-US</language>
        <category>Met</category>
        <event>Special Marine Warning</event>
        <responseType>Avoid</responseType>
        <urgency>Immediate</urgency>
        <severity>Severe</severity>
        <certainty>Likely</certainty>
        <eventCode>
            <valueName>SAME</valueName>
            <value>SMW</value>
        </eventCode>
        <eventCode>
            <valueName>NationalWeatherService</valueName>
            <value>MAW</value>
        </eventCode>
        <effective>2025-08-06T20:52:00-04:00</effective>
        <onset>2025-08-06T20:52:00-04:00</onset>
        <expires>2025-08-06T21:30:00-04:00</expires>
        <senderName>NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</senderName>
        <headline>Special Marine Warning issued August 6 at 8:52PM EDT until August 6 at 9:30PM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>SMWMHX

The National Weather Service in Newport has issued a

* Special Marine Warning for...
S of Cape Lookout NC to Surf City NC out to 20 nm...
Waters from Cape Lookout  to Surf City NC from 20 to 40 nm...

* Until 930 PM EDT.

* At 851 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm capable of producing
waterspouts was located 11 nm south of Ar345, or 15 nm west of Big
Ten Fathom, moving west at 10 knots.

HAZARD...Waterspouts and wind gusts 34 knots or greater.

SOURCE...Radar.

IMPACT...Waterspouts can easily overturn boats and create locally
hazardous seas. Small craft could be damaged in briefly
higher winds and suddenly higher waves.

* The severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly open waters.
</description>
        <instruction>Thunderstorms can produce sudden waterspouts. Waterspouts can easily
overturn boats and create locally hazardous seas. Seek safe harbor
immediately.</instruction>
