        <effective>2025-08-07T10:53:00+10:00</effective>
        <onset>2025-08-07T10:53:00+10:00</onset>
        <expires>2025-08-07T12:15:00+10:00</expires>
        <senderName>NWS Tiyan GU</senderName>
        <headline>Flood Advisory issued August 7 at 10:53AM ChST until August 7 at 12:15PM ChST by NWS Tiyan GU</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.

* WHERE...Guam.

* WHEN...Until 1215 PM ChST.

* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 1045 AM ChST, Doppler radar indicated heavy rain due to
thunderstorms. Minor flooding is ongoing or expected to begin
shortly in the advisory area.
- Rainfall rates of 1 to 2 inches per hour could lead localized
flooding in urban areas.
A rapid rise in streams and creeks could lead to flooding
along low lying roads.
- Some locations that will experience flooding include...
Dededo, Tamuning, Yigo, Mangilao, Chalan Pago-Ordot,
Barrigada, Yona, Hagatna Heights, Andersen AFB, Talofofo,
Mongmong-Toto-Maite, Sinajana, Inarajan, Asan, Merizo, Piti,
Santa Rita and Umatac.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood
</description>
        <instruction>Turn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood
deaths occur in vehicles.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
