        <senderName>NWS Rapid City SD</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 6 at 6:58PM MDT until August 6 at 7:30PM MDT by NWS Rapid City SD</headline>
        <description>At 657 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 3 miles northwest of
Aladdin, or 18 miles west of Belle Fourche, moving east at 20 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to
roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Beulah, Aladdin, and Bear Lodge Campground.

This includes Interstate 90 in Wyoming between Mile Markers 202 and
207.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
