        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued August 6 at 9:00PM EDT until August 7 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...East winds around 10 to 15 kt with gusts up to 20 kt
expected.

* WHERE...Tidal Potomac River from Key Bridge to Cobb Island MD,
Chesapeake Bay north of Pooles Island MD, and Patapsco River
including Baltimore Harbor.

* WHEN...From noon to 6 PM EDT Thursday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
