        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 7 at 8:28PM EDT until August 7 at 8:45PM EDT by NWS Gaylord MI</headline>
        <description>SVRAPX

The National Weather Service in Gaylord has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Northeastern Alpena County in northern Michigan...

* Until 845 PM EDT.

* At 827 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was just northeast
of Alpena, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Ping pong ball size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...People and animals outdoors will be injured. Expect
damage to roofs, siding, windows, and vehicles.

* This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
northeastern Alpena County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
