        <headline>Flood Advisory issued August 7 at 8:52PM EDT until August 7 at 9:00PM EDT by NWS Wilmington NC</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 9 PM EDT this evening for a
portion of southeast North Carolina, including the following area,
Columbus.

The heaviest rain has ended, however scattered light showers will
remain possible for the next few hours. Flooding rainfall is no
longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed remaining
road closures.
