POWERS LAKE, ROLETTE, ROLLA, RUGBY, SHELL VALLEY, SHERWOOD,
ST. JOHN, STANLEY, TOWNER, TURTLE LAKE, UNDERWOOD, VELVA,
WASHBURN, WATFORD CITY, WILLISTON, AND WILTON.
</description>
