        <headline>Heat Advisory issued August 7 at 8:13PM CDT until August 7 at 8:00PM CDT by NWS Wichita KS</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Heat index values up to 108 expected.

* WHERE...Portions of Central and South Central Kansas.

* WHEN...From 1 PM to 8 PM CDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures and high humidity may cause heat
illnesses.
</description>
        <instruction>Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of
the sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.</instruction>
