        <headline>Heat Advisory issued August 8 at 4:47PM MDT until August 8 at 8:00PM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...High temperatures of 95 to 101 are expected.

* WHERE...El Paso, Pueblo, and Canon City Vicinity/Eastern Fremont
County. So far today. the temperature in Pueblo reached 101
degrees.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM MDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures may cause heat illnesses.
</description>
        <instruction>Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of
the sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.</instruction>
