        <headline>Gale Warning issued August 8 at 3:13PM AKDT until August 10 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...W wind 10 to 15 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.SAT...SW wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...S wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 4 to 9 ft. Rain.
.SUN...S wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 6 to 11 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...SW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 5 to 10 ft.
.MON THROUGH WED...W wind up to 20 kt. Seas 4 to 9 ft.
</description>
