Northwestern Gogebic County in western Upper Michigan...
West central Ontonagon County in western Upper Michigan...

* Until 830 PM EDT/730 PM CDT/.

* At 726 PM EDT/626 PM CDT/, a severe thunderstorm was located near
Ironwood, moving east at 20 mph.

HAZARD...Quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

* Locations impacted include...
Ironwood, Bessemer, Wakefield, Marenisco, Hurley, Northern Lake
Gogebic, Thomaston, Clark Lake, Ironwood Airport, Copper Peak, and
Merriweather.

People attending Blasting at Copper Peak  should seek safe shelter
immediately!
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
