        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 8 at 7:38PM EDT until August 8 at 8:30PM EDT by NWS Marquette MI</headline>
        <description>At 738 PM EDT/638 PM CDT/, a severe thunderstorm was located near
Bessemer, or near Ironwood, moving east at 20 mph.

HAZARD...Half dollar size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

Locations impacted include...
Ironwood, Bessemer, Wakefield, Hurley, Northern Lake Gogebic,
Thomaston, Clark Lake, Ironwood Airport, Copper Peak, and
Merriweather.

People attending Blasting at Copper Peak  should seek safe shelter
immediately!
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
