        <description>At 749 PM EDT/649 PM CDT/, a severe thunderstorm was located near
Bessemer, or 9 miles northeast of Ironwood, moving east at 20 mph.

HAZARD...Half dollar size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

Locations impacted include...
Bessemer, Wakefield, Northern Lake Gogebic, Thomaston, Clark Lake,
and Merriweather.
</description>
