        <description>SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH 581 REMAINS VALID UNTIL 10 PM CDT /9 PM
MDT/ THIS EVENING FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS

IN NEBRASKA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 17 COUNTIES

IN NORTH CENTRAL NEBRASKA

BLAINE                BROWN                 LOUP
ROCK                  THOMAS

IN PANHANDLE NEBRASKA

DEUEL                 GARDEN

IN SOUTHWEST NEBRASKA

CHASE                 HAYES                 KEITH
LINCOLN               PERKINS

IN WEST CENTRAL NEBRASKA

ARTHUR                GRANT                 HOOKER
LOGAN                 MCPHERSON

THIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF AINSWORTH, ARTHUR, BASSETT,
BIG SPRINGS, BREWSTER, CHAMPION, CHAPPELL, DUNNING, ENDERS,
GRANT, HALSEY, HAYES CENTER, HYANNIS, IMPERIAL, LEWELLEN, MULLEN,
NORTH PLATTE, OGALLALA, OSHKOSH, PAXTON, PURDUM, RINGGOLD, ROSE,
STAPLETON, TAYLOR, THEDFORD, TRYON, AND WAUNETA.
</description>
