        <senderName>NWS St Louis MO</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 9 at 7:15PM CDT until August 9 at 7:45PM CDT by NWS St Louis MO</headline>
        <description>SVRLSX

The National Weather Service in St Louis has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Southeastern Lewis County in northeastern Missouri...
Central Marion County in northeastern Missouri...

* Until 745 PM CDT.

* At 715 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Maywood, or
8 miles northwest of Palmyra, moving east at 30 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

* Locations impacted include...
Palmyra, La Grange, Maywood and Taylor.

This includes the following State Parks...
Wakonda State Park.
</description>
        <instruction>Seek shelter inside a well-built structure and stay away from
windows. This storm is capable of producing damaging winds.

Torrential rainfall is also occurring with this storm and may lead
to flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded
roadways.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
