        <senderName>NWS Wilmington NC</senderName>
        <headline>Coastal Flood Advisory issued August 9 at 8:15PM EDT until August 9 at 10:00PM EDT by NWS Wilmington NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Up to one half foot of inundation above ground level in
low-lying areas near shorelines and tidal waterways.

* WHERE...Coastal Pender County.

* WHEN...Until 10 PM EDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Low-lying roads and locations along the Intracoastal
Waterway and adjacent tidal creeks may observe minor coastal
flooding. Check with local officials for any road closures or
impacts.
</description>
        <instruction>If travel is required, allow extra time as some roads may be
closed. Do not drive around barricades or through water of
unknown depth. Take the necessary actions to protect flood-prone
property.</instruction>
