        <senderName>NWS Goodland KS</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 9 at 6:57PM MDT until August 9 at 7:00PM MDT by NWS Goodland KS</headline>
        <description>The Severe Thunderstorm Warning that was previously in effect has
been reissued for Yuma and Cheyenne counties and is in effect until
730 PM MDT. Please refer to that bulletin for the latest severe
weather information.

A Severe Thunderstorm Watch remains in effect until 900 PM MDT/1000
PM CDT/ for northeastern Colorado...northwestern Kansas...and
southwestern Nebraska.

Remember, a Severe Thunderstorm Warning still remains in effect for
Yuma and Cheyenne counties until 730 PM MDT.
</description>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>AWIPSidentifier</valueName>
            <value>SVSGLD</value>
        </parameter>
