        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 11 at 5:57PM CDT until August 11 at 7:00PM CDT by NWS Amarillo TX</headline>
        <description>SVRAMA

The National Weather Service in Amarillo has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Northern Carson County in the Panhandle of Texas...

* Until 700 PM CDT.

* At 557 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 10 miles south of
Borger, moving southeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and half dollar size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Minor damage to roofs, siding, and trees is possible.
Hail damage to vehicles is expected.

* This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
northern Carson County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
