        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 11 at 6:03PM CDT until August 11 at 7:00PM CDT by NWS Amarillo TX</headline>
        <description>At 603 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 10 miles south of
Borger, moving southeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Two inch hail and 70 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect some tree damage. Damage is likely to mobile homes,
roofs, and outbuildings. People and animals outdoors will
be injured. Expect hail damage to roofs, siding, windows,
and vehicles.

This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
northern Carson County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
