        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...S wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 7 to 12 ft. Rain.
.TUE...S wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 7 to 10 ft.
.TUE NIGHT...W wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.WED...NW wind up to 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.WED NIGHT...NW wind up to 15 kt. Seas 3 to 6 ft.
.THU...NW wind up to 15 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.FRI THROUGH SAT...W wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
</description>
