expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...SE wind 35 kt. Seas 8 ft. Rain.
.TUE...W wind 20 kt. Seas 7 ft.
.TUE NIGHT...W wind 20 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.WED...SE wind 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.WED NIGHT...NE wind 25 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.THU...N wind 15 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.FRI...Variable wind 10 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.SAT...SW wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
</description>
