        <description>Arctic Alaska Coastal Waters out 100 NM

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent the average of the highest one-
third of the combined wind-wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...S winds 20 kt. Seas building to 4 ft.
.TUE...S winds 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.TUE NIGHT...S winds 20 kt. Seas 4 ft. Rain.
.WED...N winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft. Rain.
.WED NIGHT...N winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.THU...NW winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.THU NIGHT...E winds 10 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.FRI...E winds 10 kt. Seas 2 ft.
.SAT...S winds 10 kt. Seas 2 ft.
</description>
