        <senderName>NWS Portland OR</senderName>
        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued August 11 at 4:51PM PDT until August 12 at 11:00PM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Seas 7 to 10 ft at 10 seconds and north winds 10 to 20
kt with gusts up to 25 kt.

* WHERE...Outer Coastal Waters from Cape Shoalwater to Florence
10 to 60 NM offshore.

* WHEN...Until 11 PM PDT Tuesday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
